air and releases the moment it leaves. Works for normal guns and for weapons that charge while held.\n\nAim is a silent raycast replacement, with camera-based fallback if your executor has no metamethod hook. Wall check is on by default.\n\nESP: boxes, names, distance, HP, tracers, FOV circle. Movement: walkspeed, jump, infinite jump, noclip, fly. Unload button removes hook, connections, blur and all drawings.\n\nPress \"copy link\" once, pass the ads, come back and press \"check key\". The key is one-time, so every launch asks for a new one.","tags":["aimbot","esp","auto shoot","silent aim","tracer"],"discord":"","keyLink":"https://go.linkify.ru/2K2a","owner":{"_id":"6ab9394beb82b4b0574c9fd2","username":"uiajjss","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null},"lvl":4,"status":"offline","id":"6ab9394beb82b4b0574c9fd2","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.first_script","tier":1},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null}},"reviewed":{"name":"QueueSherlock","role":"reviewer","roleLabel":"Paid reviewer","at":"2026-10-11T06:14:07.293Z","profile":"/u/QueueSherlock"},"liked":false,"disliked":false,"cstatus":{"verdict":"none","pct":100,"conf":0.1,"n":{"w":1,"b":0,"p":0,"d":0,"k":1},"total":1,"detected":false,"key":false,"recent":0,"at":"2026-10-22T23:01:15.822Z","last":"w","win":14,"math":4},"isHub":false,"supportedGames":[],"changelog":[{"_id":"6ac3de90b584c0e0f5b934c3","editBy":{"_id":"6ab9394beb82b4b0574c9fd2","username":"uiajjss","status":"offline","id":"6ab9394beb82b4b0574c9fd2"},"message":"Create script","createdAt":"2026-10-05T17:29:52.459Z"}],"comments":[]}